# Keep the Docker build context (repo root -- see
# packages/server/Dockerfile's header comment) small and, more importantly,
# make sure the container's own `npm ci` builds native modules
# (better-sqlite3) fresh against its own OS/arch rather than reusing a
# host-built node_modules/dist that might not match.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
hook
docs
deploy
simulator/.workspaces

.claude
.twing
openrouter_key.txt
*.log
